OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATraining grants of #750 offered to
OL,4,AUkrainian refugees
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkrainian refugees in a Surrey town
OL,7,Fwill receive up to #750 to help pay for
OL,8,Ftraining and courses in a bid to help
OL,9,Fthem find work.
OL,11,FEpsom & Ewell Borough Council said it
OL,12,Fwould provide grants to current and
OL,13,Fformer beneficiaries of the Homes for
OL,14,FUkraine scheme, which can be used to
OL,15,Ffund vocational training, courses and
OL,16,Fexams.
OL,18,FThe grants aim to help people improve
OL,19,Ftheir skills and "open doors to
OL,20,Fenjoyable and fulfilling employment", a
OL,21,Fcouncil spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
